                  <num>2A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>A student also meets the citizenship or residency requirements under this section in relation to a unit of study if the student:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__subsec-2A__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
